<title id="title">Probe: altitude, speed and acceleration against time</title>
<desc id="desc">Apogee 100.0 m (328 ft) above the launch site at 5.00 s; top speed 1,234.6 m/s (4,050 ft/s) at 4.00 s.</desc>
